{"info":{"_postman_id":"d5f3e6c7-3333-4a7b-9c8d-3c4d5e6f7a8b","name":"ARKCafe NCR - Integration Tests","description":"Integration testing for the ARKCafe / Crimson NCR Django project: chained multi-request\nflows that share session/CSRF state and pass IDs between requests via collection variables.\n\nFolders run in order:\n  1. Admin session & dashboards\n  2. Projects CRUD chain (creates its own project, unique code per run)\n  3. Departments CRUD chain (creates its own department, unique name per run)\n  4. Logout & session invalidation\n  5. Staff NCR lifecycle (create -> status transitions -> edit -> search -> export)\n\nPrereqs: dev server on {{baseUrl}}, environment 'ARKCafe - Local Dev' selected,\nat least one Project and one Department in the DB (staff NCR chain picks IDs from the records page).\nUses the SAME environment as the E2E collection. All URLs keep Django's trailing slash.","schema":"https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"},"item":[{"name":"1. Admin session & dashboards","item":[{"name":"0a. GET /login/ (acquire a CSRF cookie)","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["// Clear per-run variables so a previous failed run cannot leak state into this one","['projectId','departmentId','ncrId','ncrRef','projectCode','projectName','departmentName','uniq']","  .forEach(function(k){ pm.collectionVariables.unset(k); });"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["// A live session from a previous run returns 302 to that role's dashboard - that is fine here","pm.test('Login route reachable', () => pm.expect([200, 302]).to.include(pm.response.code));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/login/"}},{"name":"0b. POST /logout/ (ensure signed out)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Sign-out attempted', () => pm.expect([200, 302, 403]).to.include(pm.response.code));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/logout/"}},{"name":"1. GET login page (fresh CSRF)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Login page 200', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/login/"}},{"name":"2. POST login as ADMIN","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Login redirects (302)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(302));","pm.test('Sent to an admin dashboard', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location') || '').to.match(/admin-dashboard|reports\\/admin\\/dashboard/));","pm.test('sessionid cookie issued', () => pm.expect(!!pm.cookies.get('sessionid')).to.be.true);"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"username","value":"{{adminEmail}}","type":"text"},{"key":"password","value":"{{adminPassword}}","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/login/"}},{"name":"3. GET admin dashboard renders (session works)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Dashboard 200', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));","pm.test('Authenticated shell rendered', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include('Crimson NCR'));","pm.test('Admin-only shell rendered (admin sidebar link)', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include('/admin-users/'));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/admin-dashboard/"}},{"name":"4. GET reports admin dashboard renders","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Reports dashboard 200', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/reports/admin/dashboard/"}}]},{"name":"2. Projects CRUD chain","item":[{"name":"1. POST add project (unique code per run)","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.collectionVariables.set('projectCode', 'INT-' + Date.now());","pm.collectionVariables.set('projectName', 'Integration Project');"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Add project redirects (302)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(302));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"project_name","value":"{{projectName}}","type":"text"},{"key":"client_name","value":"Integration Client","type":"text"},{"key":"project_code","value":"{{projectCode}}","type":"text"},{"key":"description","value":"Created by integration test","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/admin-projects/add/"}},{"name":"2. GET list - new project visible, capture ID","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Project list 200', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));","pm.test('New project appears in list', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include(pm.collectionVariables.get('projectCode')));","var escCode = pm.collectionVariables.get('projectCode').replace(/[.*+?^${}()|[\\]\\\\]/g, '\\\\$&');","const m = pm.response.text().match(new RegExp('admin-projects/(\\\\d+)/edit/[\\\\s\\\\S]{0,300}?data-project_code=\"' + escCode + '\"'));","pm.test('Project row found (matched by code)', () => pm.expect(!!m).to.be.true);","if (m) pm.collectionVariables.set('projectId', m[1]);"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/admin-projects/?q={{projectCode}}"}},{"name":"3. POST edit project","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["// Skip cleanly if an earlier step failed to capture an ID (avoids a 404 cascade)","if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('projectId')) {","  if (pm.execution && pm.execution.skipRequest) { pm.execution.skipRequest(); }","  else { postman.setNextRequest(null); }","}"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Edit redirects (302)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(302));","pm.test('Sent back to projects list', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location') || '').to.include('admin-projects'));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"project_name","value":"{{projectName}} - EDITED","type":"text"},{"key":"client_name","value":"Integration Client","type":"text"},{"key":"project_code","value":"{{projectCode}}","type":"text"},{"key":"description","value":"Edited by integration test","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/admin-projects/{{projectId}}/edit/"}},{"name":"4. GET list - edit persisted","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Edited name is visible', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include(pm.collectionVariables.get('projectName') + ' - EDITED'));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/admin-projects/?q={{projectCode}}"}},{"name":"5. POST delete project","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["// Skip cleanly if an earlier step failed to capture an ID (avoids a 404 cascade)","if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('projectId')) {","  if (pm.execution && pm.execution.skipRequest) { pm.execution.skipRequest(); }","  else { postman.setNextRequest(null); }","}"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Delete redirects (302)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(302));","pm.test('Sent back to projects list', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location') || '').to.include('admin-projects'));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/admin-projects/{{projectId}}/delete/"}},{"name":"6. GET list - deletion persisted","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Project no longer listed', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.not.include('admin-projects/' + pm.collectionVariables.get('projectId') + '/edit/'));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/admin-projects/?q={{projectCode}}"}}]},{"name":"3. Departments CRUD chain","item":[{"name":"1. POST add department (unique name per run)","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.collectionVariables.set('departmentName', 'Int Dept ' + Date.now());"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Add department redirects (302)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(302));","pm.test('Sent back to departments list', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location') || '').to.include('admin-departments'));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"action","value":"add","type":"text"},{"key":"add-department_name","value":"{{departmentName}}","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/admin-departments/"}},{"name":"2. GET list - new department visible, capture ID","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Department visible in list', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include(pm.collectionVariables.get('departmentName')));","var escName = pm.collectionVariables.get('departmentName').replace(/[.*+?^${}()|[\\]\\\\]/g, '\\\\$&');","const m = pm.response.text().match(new RegExp('data-id=\"(\\\\d+)\"[\\\\s\\\\S]{0,200}?data-name=\"' + escName + '\"'));","pm.test('Department row found (matched by name)', () => pm.expect(!!m).to.be.true);","if (m) pm.collectionVariables.set('departmentId', m[1]);"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/admin-departments/?q={{departmentName}}"}},{"name":"3. POST rename department","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.collectionVariables.set('departmentName', pm.collectionVariables.get('departmentName') + ' RENAMED');"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Rename redirects (302)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(302));","pm.test('Sent back to departments list', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location') || '').to.include('admin-departments'));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"action","value":"rename","type":"text"},{"key":"department_id","value":"{{departmentId}}","type":"text"},{"key":"rename-department_name","value":"{{departmentName}}","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/admin-departments/"}},{"name":"4. GET list - rename persisted","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Renamed department is visible', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include(pm.collectionVariables.get('departmentName')));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/admin-departments/?q={{departmentName}}"}},{"name":"5. POST delete department","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Delete redirects (302)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(302));","pm.test('Sent back to departments list', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location') || '').to.include('admin-departments'));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"action","value":"delete","type":"text"},{"key":"department_id","value":"{{departmentId}}","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/admin-departments/"}},{"name":"6. GET list - deletion persisted","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Department no longer listed', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.not.include('data-name=\"' + pm.collectionVariables.get('departmentName') + '\"'));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/admin-departments/?q={{departmentName}}"}}]},{"name":"4. Logout & session invalidation","item":[{"name":"1. POST logout","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Logout redirects', () => pm.expect([200, 302]).to.include(pm.response.code));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/logout/"}},{"name":"2. GET admin dashboard after logout is rejected","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Session invalidated: not served (302)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(302));","pm.test('Redirected to login', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location') || '').to.include('/login/'));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/admin-dashboard/"}}]},{"name":"5. Staff NCR lifecycle","item":[{"name":"0a. GET /login/ (acquire a CSRF cookie)","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["// Clear per-run variables so a previous failed run cannot leak state into this one","['projectId','departmentId','ncrId','ncrRef','uniq'].forEach(function(k){ pm.collectionVariables.unset(k); });"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["// A live session from a previous run returns 302 to that role's dashboard - that is fine here","pm.test('Login route reachable', () => pm.expect([200, 302]).to.include(pm.response.code));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/login/"}},{"name":"0b. POST /logout/ (ensure signed out)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Sign-out attempted', () => pm.expect([200, 302, 403]).to.include(pm.response.code));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/logout/"}},{"name":"1. GET login page (fresh CSRF)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Login page 200', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/login/"}},{"name":"2. POST login as STAFF","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Login redirects (302)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(302));","pm.test('Sent to the staff dashboard', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location') || '').to.match(/staff-dashboard|staff\\/dashboard/));","pm.test('sessionid cookie issued', () => pm.expect(!!pm.cookies.get('sessionid')).to.be.true);"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"username","value":"{{staffEmail}}","type":"text"},{"key":"password","value":"{{staffPassword}}","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/login/"}},{"name":"3. GET create form - capture project & department IDs","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Create form 200', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));","const body = pm.response.text();","const pSel = body.match(/name=\"project\"[\\s\\S]*?<\\/select>/);","const pOpt = pSel && pSel[0].match(/<option value=\"(\\d+)\"/);","const dSel = body.match(/name=\"department\"[\\s\\S]*?<\\/select>/);","const dOpt = dSel && dSel[0].match(/<option value=\"(\\d+)\"/);","if (pOpt) pm.collectionVariables.set('projectId', pOpt[1]);","if (dOpt) pm.collectionVariables.set('departmentId', dOpt[1]);","pm.test('Seed data found (project + department)', () => pm.expect(!!pOpt && !!dOpt).to.be.true);"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/staff-create/"}},{"name":"4. POST create NCR - capture new NCR ID from redirect","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["// Dates must be relative to today - the server forces issued_date = today\nconst _p=(n)=>String(n).padStart(2,'0');const _f=(d)=>d.getFullYear()+'-'+_p(d.getMonth()+1)+'-'+_p(d.getDate());const _n=new Date();pm.collectionVariables.set('issuedDate', _f(_n));pm.collectionVariables.set('requiredDate', _f(new Date(_n.getTime()+30*86400000)));","pm.collectionVariables.set('uniq', Date.now());"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Create NCR redirects (302)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(302));","const m = (pm.response.headers.get('Location') || '').match(/staff-records\\/(\\d+)\\//);","pm.test('Redirects to the new NCR detail', () => pm.expect(!!m).to.be.true);","if (m) pm.collectionVariables.set('ncrId', m[1]);"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"project","value":"{{projectId}}","type":"text"},{"key":"department","value":"{{departmentId}}","type":"text"},{"key":"package_no","value":"PKG-{{uniq}}","type":"text"},{"key":"cause","value":"material","type":"text"},{"key":"subject","value":"Integration NCR {{uniq}}","type":"text"},{"key":"issued_date","value":"{{issuedDate}}","type":"text"},{"key":"required_date","value":"{{requiredDate}}","type":"text"},{"key":"description","value":"Created by the integration suite","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/staff-create/"}},{"name":"5. GET detail - created as OPEN with auto reference","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["// Skip cleanly if an earlier step failed to capture an ID (avoids a 404 cascade)","if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('ncrId')) {","  if (pm.execution && pm.execution.skipRequest) { pm.execution.skipRequest(); }","  else { postman.setNextRequest(null); }","}"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Detail page 200', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));","pm.test('Reference auto-generated (NCR-...)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.match(/NCR-\\d{4}-\\d{4}/));","const refM = pm.response.text().match(/NCR-\\d{4}-\\d{4}/);","if (refM) pm.collectionVariables.set('ncrRef', refM[0]);","// Check the status badge next to THIS NCR's reference, not a substring anywhere on the page","// The flash message repeats the reference before the card; match the title-bar markup instead","pm.test('Status badge is Open', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.match(/NCR-\\d{4}-\\d{4}<\\/h2>\\s*<span class=\"badge badge-open\">[\\s\\S]{0,120}?\\bOpen\\b/));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/staff-records/{{ncrId}}/"}},{"name":"6. POST resolve without resolution type (invalid, stays open)","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["// Skip cleanly if an earlier step failed to capture an ID (avoids a 404 cascade)","if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('ncrId')) {","  if (pm.execution && pm.execution.skipRequest) { pm.execution.skipRequest(); }","  else { postman.setNextRequest(null); }","}"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Invalid status change re-renders form (200)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));","pm.test('Resolution-type error shown', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include('Choose how this NCR was resolved'));","pm.test('Status unchanged: badge still Open', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.match(/NCR-\\d{4}-\\d{4}<\\/h2>\\s*<span class=\"badge badge-open\">[\\s\\S]{0,120}?\\bOpen\\b/));"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"new_status","value":"resolved","type":"text"},{"key":"remarks","value":"missing resolution type","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/staff-records/{{ncrId}}/"}},{"name":"7. POST status: open -> in_progress","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["// Skip cleanly if an earlier step failed to capture an ID (avoids a 404 cascade)","if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('ncrId')) {","  if (pm.execution && pm.execution.skipRequest) { pm.execution.skipRequest(); }","  else { postman.setNextRequest(null); }","}"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Status update redirects (302)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(302));","pm.test('Sent back to the same NCR detail', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location') || '').to.include('/staff-records/' + pm.collectionVariables.get('ncrId') + '/'));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"new_status","value":"in_progress","type":"text"},{"key":"remarks","value":"WIP by integration test","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/staff-records/{{ncrId}}/"}},{"name":"8. GET detail - In Progress","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["// Skip cleanly if an earlier step failed to capture an ID (avoids a 404 cascade)","if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('ncrId')) {","  if (pm.execution && pm.execution.skipRequest) { pm.execution.skipRequest(); }","  else { postman.setNextRequest(null); }","}"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Status badge is In Progress', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.match(/NCR-\\d{4}-\\d{4}<\\/h2>\\s*<span class=\"badge badge-in_progress\">[\\s\\S]{0,120}?\\bIn Progress\\b/));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/staff-records/{{ncrId}}/"}},{"name":"9. POST resolve (in_progress -> resolved, with type)","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["// Skip cleanly if an earlier step failed to capture an ID (avoids a 404 cascade)","if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('ncrId')) {","  if (pm.execution && pm.execution.skipRequest) { pm.execution.skipRequest(); }","  else { postman.setNextRequest(null); }","}"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Resolve redirects (302)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(302));","pm.test('Sent back to the same NCR detail', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location') || '').to.include('/staff-records/' + pm.collectionVariables.get('ncrId') + '/'));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"new_status","value":"resolved","type":"text"},{"key":"resolution_type","value":"closed","type":"text"},{"key":"resolution_note","value":"Fixed and re-approved","type":"text"},{"key":"remarks","value":"Resolved by integration test","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/staff-records/{{ncrId}}/"}},{"name":"10. GET detail - Resolved","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["// Skip cleanly if an earlier step failed to capture an ID (avoids a 404 cascade)","if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('ncrId')) {","  if (pm.execution && pm.execution.skipRequest) { pm.execution.skipRequest(); }","  else { postman.setNextRequest(null); }","}"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Status badge is Resolved', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.match(/NCR-\\d{4}-\\d{4}<\\/h2>\\s*<span class=\"badge badge-resolved\">[\\s\\S]{0,120}?\\bResolved\\b/));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/staff-records/{{ncrId}}/"}},{"name":"11. POST reopen (resolved -> open)","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["// Skip cleanly if an earlier step failed to capture an ID (avoids a 404 cascade)","if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('ncrId')) {","  if (pm.execution && pm.execution.skipRequest) { pm.execution.skipRequest(); }","  else { postman.setNextRequest(null); }","}"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Reopen redirects (302)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(302));","pm.test('Sent back to the same NCR detail', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location') || '').to.include('/staff-records/' + pm.collectionVariables.get('ncrId') + '/'));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"new_status","value":"open","type":"text"},{"key":"remarks","value":"Reopened by integration test","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/staff-records/{{ncrId}}/"}},{"name":"12. GET detail - back to Open","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["// Skip cleanly if an earlier step failed to capture an ID (avoids a 404 cascade)","if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('ncrId')) {","  if (pm.execution && pm.execution.skipRequest) { pm.execution.skipRequest(); }","  else { postman.setNextRequest(null); }","}"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Status badge is back to Open', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.match(/NCR-\\d{4}-\\d{4}<\\/h2>\\s*<span class=\"badge badge-open\">[\\s\\S]{0,120}?\\bOpen\\b/));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/staff-records/{{ncrId}}/"}},{"name":"13. POST edit NCR (change subject)","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["// Skip cleanly if an earlier step failed to capture an ID (avoids a 404 cascade)","if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('ncrId')) {","  if (pm.execution && pm.execution.skipRequest) { pm.execution.skipRequest(); }","  else { postman.setNextRequest(null); }","}","// Dates must be relative to today - the server forces issued_date = today\nconst _p=(n)=>String(n).padStart(2,'0');const _f=(d)=>d.getFullYear()+'-'+_p(d.getMonth()+1)+'-'+_p(d.getDate());const _n=new Date();pm.collectionVariables.set('issuedDate', _f(_n));pm.collectionVariables.set('requiredDate', _f(new Date(_n.getTime()+30*86400000)));"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Edit redirects (302)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(302));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"project","value":"{{projectId}}","type":"text"},{"key":"department","value":"{{departmentId}}","type":"text"},{"key":"package_no","value":"PKG-{{uniq}}","type":"text"},{"key":"cause","value":"material","type":"text"},{"key":"subject","value":"Integration NCR {{uniq}} - EDITED","type":"text"},{"key":"issued_date","value":"{{issuedDate}}","type":"text"},{"key":"required_date","value":"{{requiredDate}}","type":"text"},{"key":"description","value":"Edited by the integration suite","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/staff-records/{{ncrId}}/edit/"}},{"name":"14. GET detail - edited subject visible","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["// Skip cleanly if an earlier step failed to capture an ID (avoids a 404 cascade)","if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('ncrId')) {","  if (pm.execution && pm.execution.skipRequest) { pm.execution.skipRequest(); }","  else { postman.setNextRequest(null); }","}"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Edited subject visible', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include('EDITED'));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/staff-records/{{ncrId}}/"}},{"name":"15. GET search filter matches created NCR","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Filtered list 200', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));","pm.test('Created NCR matches search', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include('Integration NCR ' + pm.collectionVariables.get('uniq')));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/staff-records/?q=Integration NCR {{uniq}}"}},{"name":"16. POST export Excel","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Export returns 200', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));","pm.test('Response is an xlsx file', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type') || '').to.include('spreadsheetml'));","pm.test('Sent as attachment', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Content-Disposition') || '').to.include('attachment'));","pm.test('Body is a non-empty xlsx (PK zip signature)', () => {","  pm.expect(pm.response.text().slice(0, 2)).to.eql('PK');","  pm.expect(Number(pm.response.headers.get('X-Export-Records'))).to.be.at.least(1);","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('X-Export-Filename') || '').to.match(/\\.xlsx$/);","});"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"formdata","formdata":[{"key":"export_type","value":"excel","type":"text"},{"key":"columns","value":"reference_no","type":"text"},{"key":"columns","value":"subject","type":"text"},{"key":"columns","value":"project","type":"text"},{"key":"columns","value":"cause","type":"text"},{"key":"columns","value":"status","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/staff/export/"}},{"name":"17. POST export invalid format -> 400","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Invalid export type rejected (400)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(400));","pm.test('JSON error returned', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include('Choose a valid export format'));"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"export_type","value":"bogus","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/staff/export/"}},{"name":"18. POST logout (staff)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Logout redirects', () => pm.expect([200, 302]).to.include(pm.response.code));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/logout/"}}]},{"name":"6. Authorization & negative cases","item":[{"name":"1. POST login with a wrong password is rejected","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Re-renders the login form (200, not a redirect)', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));","pm.test('No session issued', () => pm.expect(!!pm.cookies.get('sessionid')).to.be.false);","pm.test('Error message shown', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include('Incorrect email or password'));","pm.test('Still on the login form', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include('name=\"username\"'));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"description":"Negative auth: a bad password must never create a session.","body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"username","value":"{{adminEmail}}","type":"text"},{"key":"password","value":"definitely-not-the-password","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/login/"}},{"name":"2. Anonymous GET /admin-projects/ is sent to login","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Not served anonymously (302)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(302));","pm.test('Redirected to login with ?next=', () => {","  const loc = pm.response.headers.get('Location') || '';","  pm.expect(loc).to.include('/login/');","  pm.expect(loc).to.include('next=');","});"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/admin-projects/"}},{"name":"3. Anonymous GET /staff-records/ is sent to login","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Not served anonymously (302)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(302));","pm.test('Redirected to login', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location') || '').to.include('/login/'));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"GET","header":[],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/staff-records/"}},{"name":"4. POST /logout/ (reset)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Logout tolerated', () => pm.expect([200, 302, 403]).to.include(pm.response.code));"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"url":"{{baseUrl}}/logout/"}},{"name":"5. POST login as STAFF (for the role-isolation checks)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Staff session established', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(302));","pm.test('sessionid cookie issued', () => pm.expect(!!pm.cookies.get('sessionid')).to.be.true);"]}}],"protocolProfileBehavior":{"followRedirects":false},"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"X-CSRFToken","value":"{{csrfToken}}"}],"body":{"mode":"urlencoded","urlencoded":[{"key":"username","value":"{{staffEmail}}","type":"text"},{"key":"password","value":"{{staffPassword}}","type":"text"}]},"url":"{{baseUrl}}/login/"}},{"name":"6. Staff cannot open admin-only pages","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test('Admin page not served to staff', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.not.eql(200));","pm.test('Sent back to the staff dashboard', () =>","  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location') || '').to.match(/staff-dashboard|s